Hi all,

I just finished setting up apt repositories for OpenVPN. Currently
supported distributions are Debian Lenny (5.x) and Ubuntu Lucid Lynx
(10.04) in i386 and amd64 flavours. The repository will contain official
releases (currently 2.2.1). More bleeding-edge ("testing") packages may
be added in the future.

Instructions for using the repository are available here:

<https://community.openvpn.net/openvpn/wiki/OpenvpnAptRepos>

Let me know if there are any problems using the repository or the
packages. Also, if you manage to use these packages on newer
Debian/Ubuntu releases, notify me and I'll add that info to the Wiki page.

